{
  "id": "nocode-zh-diagnose",
  "name": "盆栽急救诊断",
  "type": "pipeline",
  "mode": "toolchain",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "default_source": "http://localhost:28050/text-cli/cli",
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "symptoms": {"type": "string", "description": "症状描述"}
    }
  },
  "requires": ["tc-markdown;read", "ai;infer"],
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "index",
      "instruction": "tc-markdown;read,knowledge-index.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "lookup",
      "instruction": "ai;infer,根据索引中每个文件名←对应症状的映射，匹配用户症状最像的病，输出一行纯JSON只含文件名。\n\n索引：\n{index.content}\n\n用户症状：{input.symptoms}\n\n输出示例：{\"file\":\"蚜虫.md\"} 不匹配：{\"file\":\"NOMATCH\"}",
      "output_as": "lookup"
    },
    {
      "id": "read",
      "instruction": "tc-markdown;read,knowledge/{lookup.file}"
    },
    {
      "id": "diagnose",
      "instruction": "ai;infer,你是盆栽急救医生。严格基于以下经验诊断，不编造。\n\n1.诊断 2.匹配症状 3.处理方案 4.预防建议\n\n经验：\n{read.content}\n\n症状：{input.symptoms}",
      "output_as": "diagnose"
    },
    {
      "id": "fallback",
      "instruction": "ai;infer,症状不在盆栽急救知识库范围内。基于通用植物知识给出建议，声明非专项经验。\n症状：{input.symptoms}",
      "if": "{lookup.file} == 'NOMATCH'"
    }
  ]
}
